        "category": "status",
        "types": [
          "normal"
        ],
        "description": "<p>Effect: The target leaves Combat (as per @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.MXPyYtoPDsZ4ByPh]{Recall}) and the user designates a creature on their Team, who then enters Combat (as per @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.XJ6olVrexEHDTqTM]{Send Out}). The designated ally gains the user’s @Trait[stage-change] effects, @Trait[pseudo-affliction]s, and other beneficial effects.</p><p>Restriction: This Attack can only target creatures that are part of the user’s Team.</p>",
        "free": true,
        "img": "icons/svg/explosion.svg",
        "predicate": []
      }
    ],
    "description": "<p>Connection: @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.OhO8s2Gaw1AAnuJl]{Baton Pass}</p><p>The user can use @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-perks.Item.jdQ27YKL5LkVTATx.Actions.baton-relay]{Baton Pass (Relay)}. The user can spend @PP[-2] at @Trait[interrupt] and @Trait[flinch-25] to freely use @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-perks.Item.jdQ27YKL5LkVTATx.Actions.baton-relay]{Baton Pass (Relay)} on a creature they target with @UUID[Compendium.ptr2e.core-moves.MXPyYtoPDsZ4ByPh]{Recall} or the Recall effect of \"Projectile Entry\".</p>",
